cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below.
  The corresponding journal article will be added once published.
title: >-
  Multimodal Deep Learning for Detection of Compensatory Articulation and
  Hypernasality in Patients with Cleft Palate — analysis code
abstract: >-
  Analysis pipeline for a multimodal machine learning model integrating speech
  audio, facial video, videofluoroscopic (VFS) imaging, and clinical variables
  for the detection of compensatory articulation and hypernasality in patients
  with repaired cleft palate. Includes leave-one-patient-out cross-validation,
  patient-level cluster bootstrap confidence intervals, and paired bootstrap
  comparisons between modality configurations.
